cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the software release and the associated research article."
title: "Active Brownian Predator–Prey Simulation"
version: 1.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22665064"
type: software
abstract: >
  Python simulation code for an active Brownian predator–prey model with
  constant, exponentially decaying, and segmented/oscillatory predator
  propulsion-speed protocols. The software generates simulation movies,
  predator trajectories, prey-population histories, predator-speed histories,
  and predator mean-squared displacement data.
keywords:
  - active Brownian motion
  - predator-prey dynamics
  - active matter
  - microswimmers
  - stochastic simulation
  - particle simulation
